# Barracks of the Thousand: "Whenever you cast an artifact or creature spell using mana produced by Barracks of the Thousand,
# create a white Gnome Soldier" (CR 106.3, 601.2h). Turn 3 transforms the Smithy, tapping the Gnome Soldier and four
# Ornithopters and leaving the Barracks untapped. Its {W} casts a Healer's Hawk: a second Gnome Soldier. On turn 5 a
# Healer's Hawk cast with a Plains' {W} makes none, and on turn 7 an Ornithopter cast for no mana at all makes none either:
# no mana the Barracks produced was spent on them. Bot2's Ornithopter on turn 4 is not a spell Bot1 cast ("you").

